Finally, 'eat out' means 'eat out'\h
- 'you eat outside of your home,\h\h

24
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,440
like in a restaurant or a cafe.'

25
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:52,760
'They had no food in the fridge,\h
so they decided to eat out.

26
